## How we use the data

- To run the app's core function for you.
- To send transactional emails and push notifications you requested.
- To diagnose crashes and improve reliability.
- We do not sell or rent your data.
- We do not use your data for advertising.

## Who we share with

We use the following processors to operate the service. Each is bound by a data processing agreement.

- Supabase (database and authentication)
- Stripe (subscription billing, only if you upgrade)
- Resend (transactional email, sent from contact.aigniteconsulting.ai)
- Expo Push Service plus Apple Push Notification service and Firebase Cloud Messaging (push notifications)

We share the minimum data each processor needs to perform its function.

## Your rights

- Access: email {{CONTACT_EMAIL}} for an export of your data.
- Deletion: open Settings in the app and tap "Delete account". Your data is purged within thirty days.
- Portability: the export is delivered as JSON.
- Correction: edit your profile in the app, or email us for fields not editable in-app.

## Children

This app is not intended for users under thirteen. We do not knowingly collect data from children. If you believe a child has used the app, contact {{CONTACT_EMAIL}} and we will purge their data.

## Changes

We update this policy when we add or remove a data type, change a processor, or change retention periods. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent change. Material changes are communicated in-app.

